  "description": "The Gen 2 Ultra Ripster is now a true MINI URBAN! We slimmed down the rims to a 20\" x 2\" rim and slapped on a 2.6' tire to make this bike feel even more like a BMX.\nThis update saves weight, makes the bike feel faster/more nimble, and allows the rider to choose from a much wider range of aftermarket BMX tires.\nWe are using the same Thrillmatic motor as its big bro the Ultra Urban with a 52V 15AH battery which makes the Ripster a torque monster!\nAll ZOOZ Bikes feature a 4130 Chromoly steel frames, forks, and bars and are designed for real riding.\nYes, its size accommodates smaller riders, but believe us when we say… we didn’t only build it for them, the little guy is FUN FOR EVERYONE!",
